{"subject": {"en": "you're on the list. welcome to fee fee.", "nl": "je staat op de lijst. welkom bij fee fee."}, "text": {"en": {"pre": "welcome to fee fee. invite your people and you're in earlier.", "status": "status &middot; on the list", "h1": "you're on the list.", "p1": "welcome to fee fee. freelance creatives often work alone, each on their own island. here we share real numbers, help each other and find the people we work with.", "p2": "the doors open soon, for a small group first. you'll hear from us here. until then, a letter:", "early": "get in earlier", "bring": "invite the creatives you work with. the more of us, the better the numbers, and the earlier you're in.", "btn": "share your link", "bye": "see you inside,", "role": "founder, fee fee.", "f1": "fee fee. &middot; for freelance creatives worldwide", "f2": "based in amsterdam, working worldwide", "why": "you get this because you joined the waitlist.", "unsub": "unsubscribe"}, "nl": {"pre": "welkom bij fee fee. nodig je mensen uit en je bent eerder binnen.", "status": "status &middot; op de lijst", "h1": "je staat op de lijst.", "p1": "welkom bij fee fee. freelance creatives werken vaak alleen, ieder op een eigen eiland. hier delen we echte bedragen, helpen we elkaar en vinden we de mensen met wie we werken.", "p2": "de deuren gaan binnenkort open, eerst voor een kleine groep. je hoort het hier. tot die tijd, een brief:", "early": "eerder binnen", "bring": "nodig de creatives uit met wie je werkt. hoe meer we zijn, hoe beter de cijfers, en hoe eerder jij binnen bent.", "btn": "deel je link", "bye": "tot binnenkort,", "role": "oprichter, fee fee.", "f1": "fee fee. &middot; voor freelance creatives wereldwijd", "f2": "gevestigd in amsterdam, werkt wereldwijd", "why": "je krijgt deze mail omdat je je aanmeldde voor de wachtlijst.", "unsub": "afmelden"}}, "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"{{lang}}\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\">\n<title>{{h1}}</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@1,800&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#FDFCF9}\n  a{color:#1F3FD1}\n  @media (max-width:600px){\n    .wrap{width:100%!important}\n    .pad{padding-left:24px!important;padding-right:24px!important}\n    .h1{font-size:40px!important}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#FDFCF9;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:#FDFCF9;\">{{pre}}</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#FDFCF9;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 12px 56px;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"wrap\" width=\"560\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:560px;max-width:560px;\">\n<!-- logo -->\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:8px 0 44px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://feefee.co/assets/mail/logo.png\" width=\"200\" alt=\"fee fee. what's your fee?\" style=\"display:block;width:200px;height:auto;border:0;\">\n</td></tr>\n<!-- status -->\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:0 40px;font-family:'Space Mono',Courier,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1C1E1A;\">\n  {{status}}\n</td></tr>\n<!-- headline -->\n<tr><td class=\"pad h1\" style=\"padding:14px 40px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:48px;line-height:1.02;color:#1C1E1A;\">\n  {{h1}}\n</td></tr>\n<!-- body -->\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:26px 40px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#1C1E1A;\">\n  {{p1}}\n  <br><br>\n  {{p2}}\n</td></tr>\n<!-- letter -->\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 40px 8px;\">\n  <img src=\"https://feefee.co/assets/mail/letter-01.jpg\" width=\"380\" alt=\"handwritten letter from Femke: dear creative, they want the photos for socials. socials is usage. usage is money. ask how long, where and who. then put a number on it. x femke\" style=\"display:block;width:380px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\">\n</td></tr>\n<!-- invite -->\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:36px 40px 0;\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#DEEAE0;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 28px 32px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',Courier,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1C1E1A;\">{{early}}</div>\n    <div style=\"padding-top:12px;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:#1C1E1A;\">{{bring}}</div>\n    <div style=\"padding-top:18px;font-family:'Space Mono',Courier,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#1F3FD1;word-break:break-all;\">feefee.co/?ref={{code}}</div>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\"><tr>\n      <td style=\"background:#1C1E1A;border-radius:999px;\">\n        <a href=\"https://feefee.co/?ref={{code}}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:'Space Mono',Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FDFCF9;text-decoration:none;\">{{btn}}</a>\n      </td>\n    </tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</td></tr>\n<!-- sign off -->\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" style=\"padding:40px 40px 0;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:#1C1E1A;\">\n  {{bye}}\n  <img src=\"https://feefee.co/assets/mail/x-femke.png\" width=\"130\" alt=\"x femke\" style=\"display:block;width:130px;height:auto;border:0;margin:8px 0 2px -4px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',Courier,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#6B6E66;padding-top:4px;\">{{role}}</div>\n</td></tr>\n<!-- footer -->\n<tr><td class=\"pad\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:64px 40px 0;font-family:'Space Mono',Courier,monospace;font-size:10px;line-height:1.9;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6E66;\">\n  {{f1}}<br>\n  {{f2}}<br>\n  <a href=\"https://instagram.com/feefee.co\" style=\"color:#6B6E66;\">@feefee.co</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://feefee.co\" style=\"color:#6B6E66;\">feefee.co</a><br>\n  <span style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">{{why}} <a href=\"mailto:hello@feefee.co?subject=unsubscribe\" style=\"color:#6B6E66;\">{{unsub}}</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}